# =========================
# ANTLR Generated Files
# =========================
# Ignore ANTLR generated parser/lexer classes and metadata tokens
# (Adjust the path or pattern if your generated files go to a specific directory like 'src/main/gen/' or 'target/generated-sources/')
*.tokens
*.smap
*.interp
*.bak
*.tmp

# Common ANTLR generated Java files (Lexer, Parser, Listener, Visitor)
# Use specific directory exclusions if you output generated code to a dedicated folder:
gen/
generated/
**/generatedCode/

# Example: If ANTLR generates files right alongside your .g4 or in a package structure, 
# you can ignore specific generated class names or keep grammar sources (.g4) tracked:
# *Lexer.java
# *Parser.java
# *Listener.java
# *Visitor.java

